{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOULGRAVE</strong> is a character-driven action roguelike where you create wild builds, explore ever-changing dungeons, and battle brutal bosses with puzzle-like, telegraphed mechanics. Restore a shattered world... or doom it forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/3514492a91d0fde9af242898c2f4fcca.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/3514492a91d0fde9af242898c2f4fcca.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/3514492a91d0fde9af242898c2f4fcca.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run drops you into a procedurally generated shard full of secrets, traps, enemies, and deadly arenas. You'll explore crumbling temples stuck in time, once great golden cities, forgotten prisons, and other remnants of a world lost to time.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/4ef618b47d54645dc2ca7a6173e0a787.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/4ef618b47d54645dc2ca7a6173e0a787.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/4ef618b47d54645dc2ca7a6173e0a787.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your build by unlocking and upgrading a wide arsenal of abilities and powerful relics. Build toward devastating synergies or adapt on the fly with unpredictable item drops and modifiers. No two runs play the same, and every build tells a different story in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/0916cf2f211300ceb6a3c0c8dbfa9a43.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/0916cf2f211300ceb6a3c0c8dbfa9a43.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/0916cf2f211300ceb6a3c0c8dbfa9a43.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face down vicious bosses built like MMO raid encounters, each with layered mechanics and multiple phases. Dodge through patterns, solve combat puzzles in real time, and learn from every death. Survive long enough, and you may uncover the truth behind the world\u2019s collapse and your role in its fate.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/a46383a0e4b36b625fa00620a4e4a7fa.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/a46383a0e4b36b625fa00620a4e4a7fa.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/a46383a0e4b36b625fa00620a4e4a7fa.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/33ce46b84046b88a9a9fb4f8ac9fcee6.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/33ce46b84046b88a9a9fb4f8ac9fcee6.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/33ce46b84046b88a9a9fb4f8ac9fcee6.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanic-Heavy Boss Fights</strong><br>Face off against multi-phase, telegraphed bosses inspired by MMO raid encounters. Learn their patterns, adapt in real-time, and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the Game With Wild Builds</strong><br>Combine abilities, relics, and tools to unleash devastating synergies or beautiful disasters. Every run is unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Shards</strong><br>Explore shifting, handcrafted environments filled with enemies, traps, and hidden lore. Uncover the tragic story of a world slowly succumbing to madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Upgrades, Infinite Builds</strong><br>Permanently unlock new items, upgrades, and gameplay features to expand your strategies and open up new build possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a Broken World\u2019s Secrets</strong><br>Piece together the history of a broken world and decide whether your journey will save it or end it for good.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Pixel Art, Modern Flair</strong><br>A rich pixel-art aesthetic inspired by the classics, enhanced with modern lighting, effects, and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Combat That Feels Good</strong><br>Tight controls, responsive movement, and satisfying hit feedback make every swing, dash, and dodge feel impactful.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544430?t=1759433785","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544430?t=1759433785","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/403e83c036be2ec50ffaed1b805f0e912cc17925/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759433785","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/403e83c036be2ec50ffaed1b805f0e912cc17925/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759433785","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"SOULGRAVE contains stylized fantasy violence, including frequent combat, blood effects, and character death. Players battle monsters, undead, and humanoid enemies using melee and magical abilities. Some narrative elements explore themes of loss, sacrifice, death, and certain characters reflect on the past that may be considered abusive. There is no sexual content, drug use, or depictions of abuse."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST AND FOLLOW SOULGRAVE</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/7314d688ee1393176f65bac7a515ff12.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/7314d688ee1393176f65bac7a515ff12.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/7314d688ee1393176f65bac7a515ff12.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOULGRAVE</strong> is a character-driven action roguelike where you create wild builds, explore ever-changing dungeons, and battle brutal bosses with puzzle-like, telegraphed mechanics. Restore a shattered world... or doom it forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/3514492a91d0fde9af242898c2f4fcca.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/3514492a91d0fde9af242898c2f4fcca.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/3514492a91d0fde9af242898c2f4fcca.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run drops you into a procedurally generated shard full of secrets, traps, enemies, and deadly arenas. You'll explore crumbling temples stuck in time, once great golden cities, forgotten prisons, and other remnants of a world lost to time.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/4ef618b47d54645dc2ca7a6173e0a787.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/4ef618b47d54645dc2ca7a6173e0a787.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/4ef618b47d54645dc2ca7a6173e0a787.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your build by unlocking and upgrading a wide arsenal of abilities and powerful relics. Build toward devastating synergies or adapt on the fly with unpredictable item drops and modifiers. No two runs play the same, and every build tells a different story in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/0916cf2f211300ceb6a3c0c8dbfa9a43.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/0916cf2f211300ceb6a3c0c8dbfa9a43.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/0916cf2f211300ceb6a3c0c8dbfa9a43.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face down vicious bosses built like MMO raid encounters, each with layered mechanics and multiple phases. Dodge through patterns, solve combat puzzles in real time, and learn from every death. Survive long enough, and you may uncover the truth behind the world\u2019s collapse and your role in its fate.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/a46383a0e4b36b625fa00620a4e4a7fa.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/a46383a0e4b36b625fa00620a4e4a7fa.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/a46383a0e4b36b625fa00620a4e4a7fa.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/33ce46b84046b88a9a9fb4f8ac9fcee6.poster.avif?t=1759433785\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/33ce46b84046b88a9a9fb4f8ac9fcee6.webm?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/extras/33ce46b84046b88a9a9fb4f8ac9fcee6.mp4?t=1759433785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanic-Heavy Boss Fights</strong><br>Face off against multi-phase, telegraphed bosses inspired by MMO raid encounters. Learn their patterns, adapt in real-time, and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the Game With Wild Builds</strong><br>Combine abilities, relics, and tools to unleash devastating synergies or beautiful disasters. Every run is unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Shards</strong><br>Explore shifting, handcrafted environments filled with enemies, traps, and hidden lore. Uncover the tragic story of a world slowly succumbing to madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Upgrades, Infinite Builds</strong><br>Permanently unlock new items, upgrades, and gameplay features to expand your strategies and open up new build possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a Broken World\u2019s Secrets</strong><br>Piece together the history of a broken world and decide whether your journey will save it or end it for good.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Pixel Art, Modern Flair</strong><br>A rich pixel-art aesthetic inspired by the classics, enhanced with modern lighting, effects, and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Combat That Feels Good</strong><br>Tight controls, responsive movement, and satisfying hit feedback make every swing, dash, and dodge feel impactful.</p></li></ul>","developers":["bromanguy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544430/e5458b1680646289c7f475cde4bcc1964786507a/header.jpg?t=1759433785","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright bromanguy 2025 \u00a9","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544430/712377814/87ad6e8554f317ccbdf9858ab33d875bd53230b7/1754520076/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754520503","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544430/712377814/87ad6e8554f317ccbdf9858ab33d875bd53230b7/1754520076/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754520503","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544430/712377814/87ad6e8554f317ccbdf9858ab33d875bd53230b7/1754520076/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754520503","id":257145380,"name":"SOULGRAVE Gameplay Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145380/769c2e4647d5e8e2570ab9de980d37e5b069593e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754520503"}],"name":"SOULGRAVE","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core from Intel or AMD at 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</s