rutal bosses with puzzle-like, telegraphed mechanics. Restore a shattered world... or doom it forever.","steam_appid":3544430,"support_info":{"email":"soulgravegame@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, German, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian, French, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":null}